---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../lib/site-config";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description={`How ${siteConfig.name} collects, uses, and protects your personal information.`}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-forest sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-forest/60">Last updated: 23 August 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-forest/80">
      Reverse Physio ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting
      your personal data in accordance with Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act 2012
      ("PDPA"). This policy explains what personal data we collect, why we collect it, and how
      you can contact us about it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-none space-y-8 text-forest/80">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Personal data we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Reverse Physio does not run a website contact form or online booking system — every
          appointment is arranged over WhatsApp. Depending on how you interact with us, we may
          collect:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 leading-relaxed marker:text-teal">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-forest">Contact and booking details</strong> you share with us over
            WhatsApp or email, such as your name, phone number, and preferred appointment time.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-forest">Health information</strong> you choose to share when
            booking or during treatment — for example, symptoms, medical history, imaging
            reports, or referral letters — so we can plan and deliver your care safely.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-forest">Website usage data</strong> collected automatically
            through Google Analytics, such as pages viewed, device and browser type, and
            approximate location, plus a click event whenever a WhatsApp booking link is used.
            This data is anonymised/aggregated where possible and is not tied to your name or
            contact details unless you separately message us.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">How we use your personal data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">We use your personal data only to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 leading-relaxed marker:text-teal">
          <li>respond to your enquiry and confirm, reschedule, or follow up on appointments;</li>
          <li>
            assess your condition and plan, deliver, and review your physiotherapy treatment;
          </li>
          <li>send administrative messages related to your care, such as appointment reminders;</li>
          <li>understand how visitors use this website, so we can improve it; and</li>
          <li>meet our legal and professional record-keeping obligations as a healthcare provider.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We do not use your personal data for marketing without your consent, and we do not sell
          your personal data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Who we share it with</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          We do not share your personal data with third parties for their own marketing purposes.
          Personal data may pass through the service providers we rely on to run the clinic and
          this website — WhatsApp (Meta Platforms, Inc.) for booking conversations, and Google
          Analytics for website usage data — each governed by its own privacy policy. We may also
          disclose personal data where required by law, such as to Singapore healthcare
          authorities or in response to a valid legal request.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          We keep clinical records for as long as required under Singapore healthcare
          record-keeping guidelines, and booking correspondence for as long as reasonably needed
          to support your ongoing care. When personal data is no longer needed for these purposes,
          we take reasonable steps to delete or anonymise it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">How we protect it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          We take reasonable technical and organisational steps to protect personal data against
          unauthorised access, loss, or misuse, including restricting access to clinical records
          to staff directly involved in your care.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Your rights under the PDPA</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Subject to certain exceptions under the PDPA, you may ask us to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 leading-relaxed marker:text-teal">
          <li>access the personal data we hold about you;</li>
          <li>correct any personal data that is inaccurate or out of date; and</li>
          <li>
            withdraw your consent to our collection, use, or disclosure of your personal data —
            though this may affect our ability to continue providing treatment or booking
            services to you.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          To make a request, contact us using the details below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          This website uses cookies associated with Google Analytics to understand how visitors
          use the site. You can disable cookies through your browser settings at any time; doing
          so may affect how some parts of the site behave but will not prevent you from booking an
          appointment via WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal
          requirements. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will always reflect the
          most recent revision.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest">Contact us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          If you have a question, concern, or request about how we handle your personal data,
          contact us at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="font-semibold text-teal hover:underline">
            {siteConfig.email}
          </a>{" "}
          or via{" "}
          <a
            href={siteConfig.whatsapp.generalHref}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-semibold text-teal hover:underline"
          >
            WhatsApp
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
